{"sha":"49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f","node_id":"C_kwDOAQzde9oAKDQ5MTQ3NjczMDA3YTRiMWQ2NzY2OTRlMmM1Zjg1YjgzYWQ3NmMzNmY","commit":{"author":{"name":"David Fowler","email":"davidfowl@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-16T23:57:45Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-11-16T23:57:45Z"},"message":"Reduce per-call overhead in UserValidator (#70224)\n\n* Reduce per-call overhead in UserValidator\n\nCheck allowed user name characters with a SearchValues<char> cached by the\nconfigured string instead of a LINQ Any + string.Contains per character,\nand reuse a single EmailAddressAttribute instance.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Align with repo copilot-instructions\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Retrigger CI\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: davidfowl <95136+davidfowl@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"72a688b79f2e97a2a89ee7dafeb50848e3e877b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/git/trees/72a688b79f2e97a2a89ee7dafeb50848e3e877b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/git/commits/49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq+5h5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJ7gQAFFtAHUIyOdO6s8bGLkIwL/3\nfBqlB4xVmBSAZj2j5CTqpm/vJ26Cwej1gGFD3AubX/BfskSqczC4unSNqKfzn0iD\nDYSNqt8Ar6/u3G5iDRma4FrmSfRp67Ry4yr3at6Kgj5ZL5VrI0yqbvd5p6MLtpqN\nkxGotbUpY++S8l4ibnKJglIPGpDnXQ/KbmzXYRtyMrToO/wOxvvguKJReCL2Ud1F\n4tcVRUKbI8JcVSCzg3uVXngi/UA13SYwZLskylHXUXDEjVvzDi6RxRgmFJqYUGv2\nICnQC8W9SchWkMr8NSV9n5dSZNordGl4mYjFekeudJ/aOtrgJ1BMOLdR9FmjQdbY\nzbiuPvciRrf2PGJ/4JOkYBBsJ9i2jefGAeoRS0+EYGvsFznPlHOqUeBMLma2JM8z\nU2wzWLr0F++oz6J/yDIuUwqx0CTz2FVzPeAMcEONegBM+aWMI3ZAX8vw7vpPuaCh\nJCKvhBrC08XLyY3YJhzEWNmYDQKYHsZ54SHtd41Tzwp/DdvR5joJYzHzyWAC0Cvn\nRL+IcHjuBYBnw+66DancZvMDL19nhCHMcVAgr67M1K4vAnIFlXCZ9OlOQHfuobUh\nsAoU9XlQEp5KB8/1UnoxFuy0Y63yPfROAg7g1CRoVeq59xmeNaXHFzaDfjJrdtW/\nO4hxz9PL5XeK9nGEYG/5\n=l2Fb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 72a688b79f2e97a2a89ee7dafeb50848e3e877b1\nparent 2b775ea34ceda9fb1a851f2de67d514f6fb8a18c\nauthor David Fowler <davidfowl@gmail.com> 1794873465 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1794873465 -0800\n\nReduce per-call overhead in UserValidator (#70224)\n\n* Reduce per-call overhead in UserValidator\n\nCheck allowed user name characters with a SearchValues<char> cached by the\nconfigured string instead of a LINQ Any + string.Contains per character,\nand reuse a single EmailAddressAttribute instance.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Align with repo copilot-instructions\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Retrigger CI\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: davidfowl <95136+davidfowl@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-11-16T23:57:46Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/commits/49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/commit/49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/commits/49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f/comments","author":{"login":"davidfowl","id":95136,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfowl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"2b775ea34ceda9fb1a851f2de67d514f6fb8a18c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/commits/2b775ea34ceda9fb1a851f2de67d514f6fb8a18c","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/commit/2b775ea34ceda9fb1a851f2de67d514f6fb8a18c"}],"stats":{"total":72,"additions":68,"deletions":4},"files":[{"sha":"f67b15d5001f6050ca2e6c25227768c51c3625b6","filename":"src/Identity/Extensions.Core/src/UserValidator.cs","status":"modified","additions":45,"deletions":4,"changes":49,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f/src%2FIdentity%2FExtensions.Core%2Fsrc%2FUserValidator.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f/src%2FIdentity%2FExtensions.Core%2Fsrc%2FUserValidator.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FIdentity%2FExtensions.Core%2Fsrc%2FUserValidator.cs?ref=49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f","patch":"@@ -2,9 +2,11 @@\n // The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n \n using System;\n+#if NET8_0_OR_GREATER\n+using System.Buffers;\n+#endif\n using System.Collections.Generic;\n using System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations;\n-using System.Linq;\n using System.Threading.Tasks;\n using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Shared;\n \n@@ -16,6 +18,11 @@ namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Identity;\n /// <typeparam name=\"TUser\">The type encapsulating a user.</typeparam>\n public class UserValidator<TUser> : IUserValidator<TUser> where TUser : class\n {\n+    private static readonly EmailAddressAttribute s_emailAddressAttribute = new EmailAddressAttribute();\n+#if NET8_0_OR_GREATER\n+    private static AllowedUserNameCharacters? s_allowedUserNameCharacters;\n+#endif\n+\n     /// <summary>\n     /// Creates a new instance of <see cref=\"UserValidator{TUser}\"/>.\n     /// </summary>\n@@ -58,8 +65,7 @@ public virtual async Task<IdentityResult> ValidateAsync(UserManager<TUser> manag\n             errors ??= new List<IdentityError>();\n             errors.Add(Describer.InvalidUserName(userName));\n         }\n-        else if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(manager.Options.User.AllowedUserNameCharacters) &&\n-            userName.Any(c => !manager.Options.User.AllowedUserNameCharacters.Contains(c)))\n+        else if (ContainsDisallowedCharacter(userName, manager.Options.User.AllowedUserNameCharacters))\n         {\n             errors ??= new List<IdentityError>();\n             errors.Add(Describer.InvalidUserName(userName));\n@@ -78,6 +84,33 @@ public virtual async Task<IdentityResult> ValidateAsync(UserManager<TUser> manag\n         return errors;\n     }\n \n+    private static bool ContainsDisallowedCharacter(string userName, string? allowedCharacters)\n+    {\n+        if (allowedCharacters is null || allowedCharacters.Length == 0)\n+        {\n+            return false;\n+        }\n+\n+#if NET8_0_OR_GREATER\n+        // UserValidator is typically resolved per scope, so cache the SearchValues statically, keyed by the configured string.\n+        var cache = s_allowedUserNameCharacters;\n+        if (cache is null || !string.Equals(cache.Characters, allowedCharacters, StringComparison.Ordinal))\n+        {\n+            s_allowedUserNameCharacters = cache = new AllowedUserNameCharacters(allowedCharacters);\n+        }\n+        return userName.AsSpan().ContainsAnyExcept(cache.Values);\n+#else\n+        foreach (var c in userName)\n+        {\n+            if (allowedCharacters.IndexOf(c) < 0)\n+            {\n+                return true;\n+            }\n+        }\n+        return false;\n+#endif\n+    }\n+\n     // make sure email is not empty, valid, and unique\n     private async Task<List<IdentityError>?> ValidateEmail(UserManager<TUser> manager, TUser user, List<IdentityError>? errors)\n     {\n@@ -88,7 +121,7 @@ public virtual async Task<IdentityResult> ValidateAsync(UserManager<TUser> manag\n             errors.Add(Describer.InvalidEmail(email));\n             return errors;\n         }\n-        if (!new EmailAddressAttribute().IsValid(email))\n+        if (!s_emailAddressAttribute.IsValid(email))\n         {\n             errors ??= new List<IdentityError>();\n             errors.Add(Describer.InvalidEmail(email));\n@@ -103,4 +136,12 @@ public virtual async Task<IdentityResult> ValidateAsync(UserManager<TUser> manag\n         }\n         return errors;\n     }\n+\n+#if NET8_0_OR_GREATER\n+    private sealed class AllowedUserNameCharacters(string characters)\n+    {\n+        public string Characters { get; } = characters;\n+        public SearchValues<char> Values { get; } = SearchValues.Create(characters);\n+    }\n+#endif\n }"},{"sha":"548d0709823d00b797aaf158b185ceca024708ca","filename":"src/Identity/test/Identity.Test/UserValidatorTest.cs","status":"modified","additions":23,"deletions":0,"changes":23,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f/src%2FIdentity%2Ftest%2FIdentity.Test%2FUserValidatorTest.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f/src%2FIdentity%2Ftest%2FIdentity.Test%2FUserValidatorTest.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FIdentity%2Ftest%2FIdentity.Test%2FUserValidatorTest.cs?ref=49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f","patch":"@@ -91,4 +91,27 @@ public async Task CanAllowNonAlphaNumericUserName(string userName, bool expectSu\n             IdentityResultAssert.IsFailure(result);\n         }\n     }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task UsesCurrentAllowedUserNameCharacters()\n+    {\n+        var manager = MockHelpers.TestUserManager(new NoopUserStore());\n+        var validator = new UserValidator<PocoUser>();\n+        var user = new PocoUser { UserName = \"abc\" };\n+\n+        manager.Options.User.AllowedUserNameCharacters = \"abc\";\n+        IdentityResultAssert.IsSuccess(await validator.ValidateAsync(manager, user));\n+\n+        manager.Options.User.AllowedUserNameCharacters = \"ab\";\n+        IdentityResultAssert.IsFailure(await validator.ValidateAsync(manager, user));\n+\n+        manager.Options.User.AllowedUserNameCharacters = \"\\u00e9cba\";\n+        IdentityResultAssert.IsSuccess(await validator.ValidateAsync(manager, user));\n+\n+        user.UserName = \"abc\\u00e8\";\n+        IdentityResultAssert.IsFailure(await validator.ValidateAsync(manager, user));\n+\n+        manager.Options.User.AllowedUserNameCharacters = \"abc\\u00e8\";\n+        IdentityResultAssert.IsSuccess(await validator.ValidateAsync(manager, user));\n+    }\n }"}]}